      "text": "Islamabad Traffic Police has issued a traffic advisory for May 20 due to the movement of foreign delegations in the federal capital. Traffic diversions may be placed at different times on Express Highway, Murree Road, and Club Road, which could affect the flow of traffic. Citizens have been advised to use alternative routes and service roads, travel with extra time, and cooperate with traffic officials deployed across the city.\n\n#Islamabad @ICT_Police",
